  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIIF Fund of Funds-I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project involves an equity investment of up to $100,000,000 (in Indian rupee equivalent), as of the subscription date, in the National Investment and Infrastructure Fund Limited (NIIF) managed NIIF Fund of Funds-I (NIIF-I) in India. NIIF-I proposes to invest in up to 10 private equity funds managed by domestic, experienced fund managers in India. These funds will each invest in a portfolio of growing companies in India across multiple sectors including climate or green infrastructure, affordable housing, infrastructure services, agribusiness, health care and education.</narrative>
  </description>
